{"type":"standard","title":"Adam Gray","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Adam Gray</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q3000097","titles":{"canonical":"Adam_Gray","normalized":"Adam Gray","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Adam Gray</span></span>"},"pageid":37826307,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4f/Adam_Gray%2C_official_portrait_%28119th_Congress%29.jpg/330px-Adam_Gray%2C_official_portrait_%28119th_Congress%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":413},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4f/Adam_Gray%2C_official_portrait_%28119th_Congress%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":1536,"height":1920},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1369937382","tid":"8c5e276d-9ab3-11f1-84e1-8dc92cd3af80","timestamp":"2026-08-18T03:18:57Z","description":"American politician (born 1977)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adam_Gray","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adam_Gray?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adam_Gray?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Adam_Gray"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adam_Gray","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Adam_Gray","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adam_Gray?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Adam_Gray"}},"extract":"Adam Channing Gray is an American politician who has served as the U.S. representative for California's 13th congressional district since 2025. A member of the Democratic Party, he previously served in the California State Assembly from 2012 to 2022, representing the 21st district, which included all of Merced County and portions of Stanislaus County.","extract_html":"<p><b>Adam Channing Gray</b> is an American politician who has served as the U.S. representative for California's 13th congressional district since 2025. A member of the Democratic Party, he previously served in the California State Assembly from 2012 to 2022, representing the 21st district, which included all of Merced County and portions of Stanislaus County.</p>"}